Billing settings
                
 Lists   Members   Overrides  [Rules]

▸ Default currency       — (using EUR)
  Rounding increment     — (rounding off)
  Rounding mode          nearest
  Rounding scope         per entry
  Timezone               — (system local)

The default currency and rounding rule apply to every list without its own currency.

Rate precedence: (list,member) > member > list > default
A rate of 0 bills at zero — to unset a value instead, submit an empty field.